{"seq":3,"slug":"web-animations-api","title":"Web Animations API：命令式动画控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/foundations/web-animations-api","wordCount":708,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"web-animations-api-命令式动画控制\">Web Animations API：命令式动画控制</h1><p>Web Animations API（WAAPI）是 CSS 动画系统的 JavaScript 等价物，同时也是底层动画引擎的直接接口。它提供了 CSS 动画缺少的精确控制能力：暂停、倒放、seek 到任意时间点、动态修改播放速率，以及通过 Promise 钩子与业务逻辑集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"element-animate-创建动画\">Element.animate()：创建动画</h2><p><code>Element.animate()</code> 是 WAAPI 的核心方法，返回一个 <code>Animation</code> 对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const animation = element.animate(&#10;  // 关键帧：等价于 @keyframes&#10;  [&#10;    { opacity: 0, transform: &#39;translateY(-20px)&#39; },&#10;    { opacity: 1, transform: &#39;translateY(0)&#39; },&#10;  ],&#10;  // 选项：等价于 animation 属性&#10;  {&#10;    duration: 300, // ms，不是秒&#10;    easing: &#39;ease-out&#39;,&#10;    fill: &#39;forwards&#39;,&#10;    delay: 0,&#10;    iterations: 1,&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> animation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 关键帧：等价于 @keyframes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateY(-20px)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateY(0)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 选项：等价于 animation 属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ms，不是秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    easing: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ease-out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fill: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forwards'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    delay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    iterations: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"关键帧格式\">关键帧格式</h3><p>WAAPI 支持两种关键帧格式：</p>\n<p><strong>数组格式</strong>（推荐）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 隐式 offset：均匀分布&#10;element.animate(&#10;  [&#10;    { transform: &#39;scale(1)&#39;, opacity: 1 },&#10;    { transform: &#39;scale(1.2)&#39;, opacity: 0.8 },&#10;    { transform: &#39;scale(1)&#39;, opacity: 1 },&#10;  ],&#10;  { duration: 600 },&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 显式 offset：精确控制时间点&#10;element.animate(&#10;  [&#10;    { transform: &#39;translateX(0)&#39;, offset: 0 },&#10;    { transform: &#39;translateX(100px)&#39;, offset: 0.7 }, // 70% 时到达&#10;    { transform: &#39;translateX(80px)&#39;, offset: 1 }, // 最终位置&#10;  ],&#10;  { duration: 1000 },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 隐式 offset：均匀分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scale(1)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scale(1.2)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scale(1)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 显式 offset：精确控制时间点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateX(0)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateX(100px)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 70% 时到达</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateX(80px)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最终位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>对象格式</strong>（属性数组形式）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"element.animate(&#10;  {&#10;    opacity: [0, 1],&#10;    transform: [&#39;translateX(-50px)&#39;, &#39;translateX(0)&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  { duration: 300, easing: &#39;ease-out&#39; },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    opacity: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transform: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateX(-50px)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateX(0)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, easing: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ease-out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"keyframeeffect-选项\">KeyframeEffect 选项</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>duration</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>单次持续时间（ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>delay</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>启动延迟（ms，可为负值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>endDelay</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>结束后延迟（ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>easing</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>缓动函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fill</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>填充模式：<code>none</code>/<code>forwards</code>/<code>backwards</code>/<code>both</code>/<code>auto</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>iterations</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>循环次数，<code>Infinity</code> 无限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>direction</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td><code>normal</code>/<code>reverse</code>/<code>alternate</code>/<code>alternate-reverse</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>iterationStart</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>从哪个迭代偏移量开始（0-1）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>composite</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>关键帧合成方式：<code>replace</code>/<code>add</code>/<code>accumulate</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"animation-对象-播放控制\">Animation 对象：播放控制</h2><p><code>Element.animate()</code> 返回的 <code>Animation</code> 对象提供完整的播放控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const animation = element.animate([{ transform: &#39;rotate(0deg)&#39; }, { transform: &#39;rotate(360deg)&#39; }], {&#10;  duration: 2000,&#10;  iterations: Infinity,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 播放控制&#10;animation.pause();&#10;animation.play();&#10;animation.reverse();&#10;animation.cancel(); // 立即停止并重置&#10;&#10;// 时间控制&#10;animation.currentTime = 1000; // seek 到 1000ms&#10;animation.playbackRate = 2; // 2 倍速播放&#10;animation.playbackRate = -1; // 倒放&#10;&#10;// 状态查询&#10;console.log(animation.playState); // &#39;idle&#39; | &#39;running&#39; | &#39;paused&#39; | &#39;finished&#39;&#10;console.log(animation.currentTime);&#10;console.log(animation.effect.getTiming());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> animation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([{ transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rotate(0deg)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rotate(360deg)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }], {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  iterations: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 播放控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">animation.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pause</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">animation.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">play</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">animation.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">animation.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 立即停止并重置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 时间控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">animation.currentTime </span><span style=\"color:#